    <string name="m41435a2ebe1d" formatted="false">成人向けの目安には年齢と性別を入力してください。目標はいつでも自由に設定できます。</string>
    <string name="m70c97e49902d" formatted="false">目標は自分で選べます。達成後も追加で飲んだ量を記録できます。</string>
    <string name="m6cca7b494136" formatted="false">成人の目安：EFSAの総水分摂取量を基に、20%を食事から摂ると仮定し、飲み物を男性2.0 L、女性1.6 Lと推定しています。個人への処方ではなく開始時の参考値です。</string>
    <string name="m3d86af08cf5c" formatted="false">体重・身長・カロリー・サプリのグラム数だけでは個人の必要水分量は決まりません。クレアチンやプロテインによる自動加算は行いません。シェイクに混ぜた水は実際の体積で記録してください。</string>
    <string name="m5ed029043c65" formatted="false">Adjust base goal with my profile</string>
    <string name="m8886b682c249" formatted="false">A rough planning estimate for low activity. Heat, exercise and health can change your needs.</string>
    <string name="m182ec4b8dc60" formatted="false">Complete an adult profile with age, sex, height and weight for an estimate. Your custom base goal is used otherwise.</string>
    <string name="mc5a588cb7f12" formatted="false">Supplement-day extras</string>
    <string name="me70bccd1d729" formatted="false">Optional personal targets, not an established water requirement. Zero keeps them off. Only supplements actually recorded for that day activate the extra.</string>
    <string name="m7ffd031e07a9" formatted="false">Set the matching supplement target in grams above. Half the target adds half your chosen extra, up to the full daily extra. No supplement today means no extra bottles.</string>
    <string name="md72fc8ed45e3" formatted="false">The profile estimate uses age, sex, height and weight to estimate resting energy, assumes low activity and 20% water from food, then rounds to 50 ml. It is an adjustable planning aid, not a measured requirement.</string>
    <string name="mb24ae688b9d8" formatted="false">Research does not establish extra litres per gram of creatine or protein powder. Dashed bottles represent only the extra you choose. They never record water as already drunk.</string>
